NO SIGNIFICANT SONOLOGICAL ABNORMALITY DETECTED IN ABDOMEN AND PELVIS.

=== FINDINGS ===
STUDY: ULTRASONOGRAPHY OF WHOLE ABDOMEN & PELVIS (MALE)

FINDINGS:
- LIVER: Normal in size (13.8 cm) and shape. Echotexture is homogeneous. No focal parenchymal lesion, cyst, or IHBRD noted. Portal vein is normal.
