- KIDNEYS:
  * Right Kidney: Measures 10.4 cm. Normal cortical thickness and echogenicity. No calculus or hydronephrosis.
  * Left Kidney: Measures 10.6 cm. Normal cortical thickness and echogenicity. No calculus or hydronephrosis.
- URINARY BLADDER: Well-distended with smooth mucosal margins. Lumen clear.
- PROSTATE: Normal in size, measuring 3.6 x 3.2 x 3.0 cm (Approx weight: 18 grams). Homogeneous parenchymal echotexture. Capsular margin is intact. Post-void residual (PVR) urine volume is insignificant.
- PERITONEAL CAVITY: No ascites or retroperitoneal lymphadenopathy.